{
  "name": "dsh-opencode-zen-free",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "DSH Desktop plugin: komplett kostenlose Free-Modelle via OpenCode Zen — OpenAI-Chat, Responses (Muse Spark 1.3) & Anthropic (Muse) — mit Multi-Account Rotation, Auto-Discovery & User-Agent Bypass",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
